[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_bnqqw")
dialogue_id = "debate_transience"
record_title = "Debate Speech: Against the Storm"
text = "PAGE: historian(PORTAL_NETWORK), AUDIENCE
historian: Imagine a city where sandstorms cover the buildings up to their roofs every other season.
historian: Would you stay there, spending your day shoveling dust only to find yourself buried again in the morning?
historian: Such cities exist, you know?
historian: And people live there.
historian: When the storms blow, they pack up their belongings and move across the shard, returning with the next season.
historian: These people learned that it is easier when you adapt, even if you have to change your way of life.
historian: They learned to make the best of a situation rather than spend all their effort fighting against a force of nature.
historian: When the world shattered, we adapted.
historian: We learned to live on these shards.
historian: To keep struggling for a dream of Reunification is to spend our lives shoveling sand in a sandstorm."
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://jtkfcsyiryo4"
